94	 * under Cleric" stops being a fact and becomes a claim, and a log that
95	 * sells itself on being an honest record should not be making claims it
96	 * cannot check. So the flag is set the moment the operations stop
97	 * matching what the setups handed over, and the screen says "seeded
98	 * from" rather than "played under" when it is.
99	 */
100	export interface ChosenSetup {
